# A core with no machine before its first frame: until console 0's first
# retro_run, its retro_unserialize loads nothing and says it did
# (link_test_mode cold_load). warm=1 runs that console's frame 0
# before the from run's load, alone and unseen: it is cabled to nothing
# then, draws both parts of a picture nobody keeps, and the load puts the
# bus and both consoles as the save left them.
console 0 core=test warm=1
console 1 core=test
option 0 link_test_render soft
option 0 link_test_mode cold_load
option 0 link_test_seed 3
option 1 link_test_seed 7
0 cable 0:0 1:0
60 save mid
60 checkpoint in_flight
90 checkpoint later
120 end
